  "description": "Pressured by her demanding mother and hated by others for her intelligence, Han Narae led a miserable life, dying tragically at a young age. Reborn as Lysia Ambrose, the magical daughter of a count, all she wants to do this time is live a quiet life while attending the prestigious Asteria Academy. Though she tries her best to hide her true powers and live normally, she proves surprisingly popular. Now rubbing elbows with school celebrities, will Lysia’s plan to fade into the background fail? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
